                <h2 class="h1"><span class="span-pink-2">Who is GotPhoto</span> <br>and what they need</h2>
              </div><img src="/images/Why-animation-matters---shorten-3_2.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2402px) 100vw, 2402px" srcset="/images/Why-animation-matters---shorten-3_2Why-animation-matters---shorten-3.avif 500w, /images/Why-animation-matters---shorten-3_2Why-animation-matters---shorten-3.avif 800w, /images/Why-animation-matters---shorten-3_2Why-animation-matters---shorten-3.avif 1080w, /images/Why-animation-matters---shorten-3_2.avif 2402w" alt="A black and white photo of a purple light" class="image-bg-streamlined"><img sizes="(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px" srcset="/images/Frame-1707478537_2Frame-1707478537.avif 500w, /images/Frame-1707478537_2.avif 2400w" alt="A purple background with squares and dots" src="/images/Frame-1707478537_2.avif" loading="lazy" class="image-why_shoose">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div wb-interval-delay="0.2" wb-component="smart-animate" class="_2-columns">
            <div id="w-node-cf4dfba4-6c3d-8882-fd66-a19d22296fae-869ae8d1" class="card-contaiiner fill-height">
              <div class="card cursor got-photo">
                <div class="line-gradient-2 bottom"></div><img src="/images/who-gotphoto-transparent_1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 601px) 100vw, 601px" height="Auto" alt="Smiling man wearing a hat holding a camera, with a laptop screen showing a photo management interface and the text gotphoto.com." srcset="/images/who-gotphoto-transparent_1who-gotphoto-transparent.avif 500w, /images/who-gotphoto-transparent_1.avif 601w" class="img-branding full-lenght">
              </div>
