            <div class="w-layout-vflex list-wrap no-top-margin">
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-gotphoto">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">GotPhoto is based in both the USA and Germany, and they&#x27;re shaking up the people photography industry with smart digital tools. Their goal is to help photographers, the creative pros capturing life’s best moments, grow their businesses and do what they love. After securing new investment, the team started expanding fast and building out their product offerings, which meant they needed way more content, and fast. That&#x27;s where we stepped in, <a href="/services/explainer-video" class="link-13">giving them the creative support to keep up with their momentum.</a><br><br>What they need:</div>
