                      <div class="gap-8 padding-0">
                        <h3 class="heading-24-120">New direction</h3>
                        <div class="text-14-150-2 opacity-80">After receiving new investment, they needed to refresh their brand and create new content. That shift meant more content requests, including resized and translated videos that came in without a set schedule but still needed quick turnarounds.</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
